THESE ARE THE STEPS TO FOLLOW FOR COPY THE FILES FROM INSTANCE TO GOOGLE CLOUD STORAGE BUCKETS

1.create a service account and give storage admin role[access buckets]

2.create a virtual machine and attach the service account while creation and give access to all cloud apis 

3.go to cloud  shell to check the service account is set or not for run command
# gcloud config list

# create a key for the service accounts

gcloud iam service-accounts keys create [keyname.json] --iam-account [service account name]  {done in cloud shell}

# to activate the service account run the command in {vm ssh}

gcloud auth activate-service-account [service account name] --key-file [keyfilename]



#then we send or copy the file from vm to buckets
